.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mouser-engine 1  "mouser-engine 1.2.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
mouser\-engine \- Manage GPU rendering engines (mouser, skia, custom); the same as `mouser plugin … \-\-kind engine` (engines are plugins); see docs/engines.md
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmouser engine\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage GPU rendering engines (mouser, skia, custom); the same as `mouser plugin … \-\-kind engine` (engines are plugins); see docs/engines.md
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
mouser\-engine\-list(1)
List plugins (or engines) by priority, with what each provides and its state
.TP
mouser\-engine\-install(1)
Install from a directory with plugin.toml (or an engine\*(Aqs engine.toml)
.TP
mouser\-engine\-uninstall(1)
Remove an installed plugin or engine (and a plugin\*(Aqs saved permissions)
.TP
mouser\-engine\-enable(1)
Turn a plugin or engine on (built\-ins included)
.TP
mouser\-engine\-disable(1)
Turn a plugin or engine off without removing it (not the mouser engine)
.TP
mouser\-engine\-use(1)
Engines: put this engine first in the priority order (and unskip it)
.TP
mouser\-engine\-priority(1)
Set the priority order (the rest keep their order; for engines mouser stays last)
.TP
mouser\-engine\-move(1)
Move one: first, last, up, down or a 1\-based position
.TP
mouser\-engine\-unskip(1)
Engines: stop skipping one that crashed Mouser (and clear its failure) without selecting it
.TP
mouser\-engine\-permissions(1)
List every saved permission (no NAME), show or set one (`cap=allow|ask|never ...`, `*=never` for all), or `NAME revoke`
.TP
mouser\-engine\-probe(1)
Start an MCP plugin, do the handshake and list its tools
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBmouser\fR(1)
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
